        'Romaji: Watashi ga hajimete nihongo de okyakusama ni meeru o kaita no wa, kyonen no natsu deshita. Kaishamei no ato ni "onchuu" to "sama" o ryouhou tsukete shimai, senpai ni naoshite itadakimashita. Mata, "sasete itadakimasu" o nando mo tsukatte, kaette yominikui meeru ni natte imashita. Ima wa, kenmei o mita dake de youken ga wakaru you ni kaki, okuru mae ni kanarazu yominaoshite imasu. Keigo wa aite o taisetsu ni suru kimochi o tsutaeru tame no mono da to zonjimasu. Kore kara mo, wakariyasuku teinei na meeru o kakeru you doryoku shite mairimasu.',
